/run-logs/
tools/adtlib-env/
tools/python3.7-base/
tools/vamp-build/vamp-plugin-sdk/
tools/vamp-build/nnls-chroma/
tools/vamp-plugins/
/chords/
/corrected/
# Exception: the analysis design docs under output/analysis/ are authored
# reasoning/methodology (which empirical choice was made and why, bugs
# found and fixed), not regenerable pipeline output like the rest of
# output/ - checked in for the same reason ground_truth/ is, below. The
# CSVs alongside them (chord_sequences.csv, note_similarity_matrix.csv,
# etc.) stay ignored - regenerable via `make build-chord-sequences` /
# `make run-note-alignment` / etc. from the committed scripts. Git can't
# re-include a file whose parent directory is itself ignored, so /output/
# is excluded one level down (/output/*), not as a whole directory, to
# leave room for these nested re-includes.
/output/*
!/output/analysis/
/output/analysis/*
!/output/analysis/*.md
# The Meaningless Love experiment report and Tidal sketch are authored,
# reproducible review artifacts; its audio diagnostics and intermediate CSVs
# remain local generated analysis output.
!/output/analysis/meaningless_love/
/output/analysis/meaningless_love/*
!/output/analysis/meaningless_love/*.md
!/output/analysis/meaningless_love/*.tidal
# The arpeggio transcription/search report is authored review material; keep
# downloaded models, transcriptions, reference scores, and CSVs local.
!/output/analysis/arpeggio_experiment/
/output/analysis/arpeggio_experiment/*
!/output/analysis/arpeggio_experiment/REPORT.md
ground_truth_anchor/*/*.wav
ground_truth_anchor/*/*.mid

# Generated local review catalog. Private lyrics/models remain under output/.
/preview/rhythm-layers/data.json
/preview/rhythm-layers/diagnostics/

# Retired outputs stay on disk, including authored historical review artifacts.
/output/
/docs/data/
/preview/rhythm-layers/
/instrumentals/audio/
/instrumentals/stems/
/instrumentals/.partial/
/instrumentals/catalog.json
/instrumentals/catalog.sqlite*
/midi_backup_pre_onset_fix/

# New model caches, private lyric text, diagnostic crops and analysis results.
/outputs/
/data/genius_html/

# Local tools and caches
/.codex-attachments/
/.uv-cache-codex/
.pytest_cache/
**/__pycache__/
/.claude/settings.local.json
**/private/
**/model_cache/
**/scratch/
**/vendor/

